  maxHealth: 440
  contactDamage: 2
  scoreReward: 20000
  description: A clockwork sphinx that was here before the host and intends to be
    here after. The zodiac turns behind it because time, too, waits its turn.
  tactics: Stillness lays cross-quads through sine curtains - deceptively calm; learn
    its spacing. Motion (65%) adds a spiral and Hexblade summons. Eternity (35%)
    is dense rings, storm crosses, and the gyre at 1.6x hover with Ravagers hunting
    you. The hardest fight in the game; every powerup cap and every color rule you
    have learned is the entry fee.
